{"type":"message","id":"59d0c7a0","parentId":"6c3ea883","timestamp":"2026-05-15T23:25:38.162Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 15th, 2026 - 11:25 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-15 23:25 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778887537955}}
{"type":"message","id":"0a2b5b10","parentId":"59d0c7a0","timestamp":"2026-05-15T23:25:43.395Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for messages in two threads: arbitration and general. I need to fetch the history for both threads and respond to any new discussions.\n\nLet me fetch both histories in parallel.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-732ccc02-bddf-45a9-9322-16b1c23a1036","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8e821c14-fcf2-47a4-bf5e-9e828ce0583d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | jq ."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":183,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11306,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778887538163,"responseId":"chatcmpl-024aaae8-22b9-4857-911e-7c439c412774"}}
